<title>UK: ICCO invites bids for up to 4,250 tonnes of cocoa.</title>
<headline>ICCO invites bids for up to 4,250 tonnes of cocoa.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Cocoa Organization (ICCO) said on Wednesday it is inviting bids for up to 4,250 tonnes of cocoa by 11.40 GMT.</p>
<p>It said the offer related to the list published on April 25.</p>
<p>Acceptances will be communicated to the parties concerned by 1300 GMT.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
</text>
